{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_01",
      "hash": "f39570eca3c31d1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳終於來啦，\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_02",
      "hash": "f3956feca3c31b67",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的船票！\\n這遊輪裡不但寬敞，\\r\\n而且還有好多訓練家……"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_01",
      "hash": "1b1bfc19f9bb010b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「Bonjour！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]還有[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\r\\n沒想到會在這種地方遇上你們啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_03",
      "hash": "f3956eeca3c319b4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「青綠哥！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_04",
      "hash": "f3956deca3c31801",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你是要搭船去旅行嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_02",
      "hash": "1b1bfd19f9bb02be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「不是不是。\\c\\n我是被邀請來\\n參加遊輪派對的，\\r\\n不過現在正打算要走了！\\c\\n我買了很多土產喔！\\n順便分你們一個吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0410_system_01",
      "hash": "e66cedb289b19491",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從青綠那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]娑羅沙布蕾[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_03",
      "hash": "1b1bfe19f9bb0471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「比起這個……\\n我在派對上聽到了個傳聞。\\c\\n你們聽過『火箭隊』嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0410_select_01",
      "hash": "df9b2d484fb661a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是一群壞蛋！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0410_select_02",
      "hash": "df9b2c484fb65ff3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "之前跟他們對戰過……"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_04",
      "hash": "1b1bff19f9bb0624",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「是啊。\\n看來傳聞已經傳開了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_05",
      "hash": "1b1c0019f9bb07d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「真的假的！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳膽子還真大啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0410_green_06",
      "hash": "1b1c0119f9bb098a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "總而言之！據說火箭隊\\n是個會利用寶可夢\\r\\n來牟取暴利的危險組織。\\c\\n看來我該去調查一下……\\n你們也要小心啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_05",
      "hash": "f3956ceca3c3164e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「火箭隊嗎……\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，如果下次那些傢伙\\n又來找[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳麻煩，記得叫我啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0410_rival_06",
      "hash": "f3956beca3c3149b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「青綠哥\\n可是非常厲害的喔！\\c\\n聽說他在好幾年前\\n就已經戰勝過\\r\\n寶可夢聯盟的四天王了！\\c\\n不過我聽說他曾經\\n敗給了他的勁敵呢！\\r\\n真無法想像那個人\\r\\n厲害到什麼程度！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d0303",
      "hash": "a8d7eed43e76e7e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p02_cave_d0303",
      "hash": "f1e912992bb5831f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 16]"
    },
